      "content": "SP 8707               WENDOVER          CHURCH LANE 11/225                                  Wall to kitchen garden at                                         Wendover House School GV                                      II Wall surrounding former kitchen garden.C18. Red brick with blue vitreous headers, 1.5m high approx., some parts with rounded coping bricks. Gabled arch to entrance forecourt with semi-circular headed opening. Larger gabled triple archway to garden concealed by ivy. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP8713607217"
